Abstract = {The Astrobiology Primer 3.0 (ABP3.0) is a concise introduction to the
   field of astrobiology for students and others who are new to the field
   of astrobiology. It provides an entry into the broader materials in this
   supplementary issue of Astrobiology and an overview of the
   investigations and driving hypotheses that make up this
   interdisciplinary field. The content of this chapter was adapted from
   the other 10 articles in this supplementary issue and thus represents
   the contribution of all the authors who worked on these introductory
   articles. The content of this chapter is not exhaustive and represents
   the topics that the authors found to be the most important and
   compelling in a dynamic and changing field.},
