Number = {1},
Pages = {183-214},
Abstract = {In this paper we consider a concept defined by Nadler which is the dual
   to the concept of a selectible space, namely, a Lambda-coselection space
   (Lambda may be any given hyperspace of a space X ). We investigate the
   concept when Lambda is the n th symmetric product F-n ( X ). We
   characterize F-2-coselection spaces among a particular class of local
   dendrites. We also determine several sufficient conditions for a space X
   to be an F 3-coselection space.},
