Abstract = {The genesis of the pandemic is discussed from a critical perspective
   that understands it as a symptom of the crisis of civilization. With
   this, the intersections between the restraints imposed by the capital
   system through its logic of profit maximization and the coloniality of
   nature, which relegates it to a subaltern space to be exploited without
   distinction of regime. These processes, inserted in extractive dynamics
   that configure the dominant productive matrix. Which, marked by the
   appropriation/expropriation of tangible and intangible common goods,
   stands as its catalyst.},
