Abstract = {For the class K of meromorphic functions outside a compact countable set
   of essential singularities, we study the dynamics of some functions in K
   for which the unit disc and its complement are invariant. These
   functions are products and compositions of the function E-1
   =exp(z-1/z+1) with Blaschke products, that include the family E-n =exp
   z(n)-1/z(n)+1, which are the main topic of the article. Slices of the
   space of parameters of E-n are given with a discussion of their main
   features. We construct a Poincare extension of E-n to the hyperbolic
   three-dimensional space and to the 3-sphere. Also we study their
   dynamics.},
